{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Oelala API",
    "description": "AI-powered video and image generation API. Generate stunning content with text prompts or source images.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Oelala",
      "url": "https://oelala.xyz"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.oelala.xyz",
      "description": "Production"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:7998",
      "description": "Local development"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/generate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "API v1"
        ],
        "summary": "Generate",
        "description": "Generate image or video using AI.\n\n**Authentication:** Requires API key via `X-API-Key` header.\n\n**Credit Costs:**\n- Text-to-Image (SDXL): ~10 credits\n- Text-to-Video (Wan2.2): ~50-200 credits depending on duration\n- Image-to-Video (Wan2.2): ~50-200 credits depending on duration\n\n**Rate Limits:** TBD (per API key)\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://oelala.xyz/api/v1/generate \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: oelala_your_key_here\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"type\": \"text-to-image\",\n    \"prompt\": \"a beautiful sunset over mountains\",\n    \"width\": 1024,\n    \"height\": 1024\n  }'\n```",
        "operationId": "generate_api_v1_generate_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GenerateRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GenerateResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/jobs/{job_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "API v1"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Job Status",
        "description": "Get status of a generation job.\n\n**Authentication:** Requires API key via `X-API-Key` header.\n\n**Job Statuses:**\n- `queued`: Job is waiting to start\n- `running`: Job is currently processing\n- `completed`: Job finished successfully, result ready for download\n- `failed`: Job failed with error\n\n**Polling:** Poll this endpoint every 5-10 seconds until status is `completed` or `failed`.\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl https://oelala.xyz/api/v1/jobs/abc-123 \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: oelala_your_key_here\"\n```",
        "operationId": "get_job_status_api_v1_jobs__job_id__get",
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "job_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Job Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobStatus"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/download": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "API v1"
        ],
        "summary": "Download Job Result",
        "description": "Download the result of a completed job.\n\n**Authentication:** Requires API key via `X-API-Key` header.\n\n**Prerequisites:** Job must be in `completed` status (check with `/jobs/{job_id}` first).\n\n**Response:** Binary file (image/png, image/jpeg, or video/mp4)\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl https://oelala.xyz/api/v1/jobs/abc-123/download \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: oelala_your_key_here\" \\\n  -o result.mp4\n```",
        "operationId": "download_job_result_api_v1_jobs__job_id__download_get",
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "job_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Job Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
